      "text": "North Seymour or South Plaza"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "3300236d5bbd298547c04514c6ec0d6471f68488b2826a165698262b6e7401a7",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-a769ac8379f2d25c8c252a41",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "The specific island is confirmed after booking. There are two equivalent options.\n\n**Option 1. North Seymour and Las Bachas beaches**\n\nReturn to Puerto Ayora at about 16:00. The rest of the day is yours to spend at leisure.\n\n**Option 2. South Plaza and Punta Carrión**\n\nFrom a high vantage point, you can see the ocean and the large waves breaking against the rocks. After the walk, the yacht heads to Punta Carrión. Lunch is served on board. Near the point, you'll have time to swim and snorkel among rays, reef sharks, Galápagos sharks and a variety of tropical fish.\n\nAfter the excursion, return to the hotel for an evening at leisure.\n\n**Accommodation:** Solymar 4*, Ocean View Room.  \n**Meals:** breakfast and lunch."
    },
